{"seq":27,"slug":"chaos-engineering","title":"混沌工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering","rating":{"composite":4.17,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":4,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"混沌工程\">混沌工程</h1><p>混沌工程（Chaos Engineering）是一种通过在生产或准生产环境中<strong>主动注入故障</strong>来验证系统韧性的工程学科。它由 Netflix 在 2011 年通过 Chaos Monkey 项目推广，核心理念是：与其被动等待生产事故，不如主动制造可控的小规模故障来提前发现系统的薄弱环节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-定位\">本 Hub 定位</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比 Hub</th>\n<th>关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../cloud-infrastructure/sre-reliability/\">可靠性工程（SRE）</a></td>\n<td>混沌工程是 SRE 实践的重要工具，服务于可靠性目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operations/\">Kubernetes 运维</a></td>\n<td>Kubernetes 是混沌实验的主要执行环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../cloud-infrastructure/observability-engineering/\">可观测性工程</a></td>\n<td>没有可观测性就无法度量混沌实验的影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../../cs-fundamentals/distributed-systems-fundamentals/\">分布式系统基础</a></td>\n<td>混沌工程是验证分布式系统理论假设的实践手段</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"学习路径\">学习路径</h2><ol>\n<li><strong>原则与基础</strong>（第一章）：理解混沌工程的思维模型、稳态假说和爆炸半径控制</li>\n<li><strong>实验设计</strong>（第二章）：掌握故障注入类型、实验设计方法和 GameDay 演练</li>\n<li><strong>平台与工具</strong>（第三章）：熟悉 Chaos Monkey、Litmus、Chaos Mesh 等主流工具</li>\n<li><strong>成熟度与组织实践</strong>（第四章）：了解团队如何系统性推进混沌工程能力建设</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><ul>\n<li>基本的分布式系统概念（容错、副本、服务降级）</li>\n<li>Kubernetes 基础操作（Pod、Deployment、Service）</li>\n<li>可观测性基础（Prometheus、Grafana 或类似工具）</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"principles","title":"第一章：混沌工程原则与基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-principles","title":"混沌工程核心原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/chaos-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"resilience-patterns","title":"韧性系统设计模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/resilience-patterns"},{"seq":3,"slug":"chaos-metrics","title":"混沌实验度量框架","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/principles/chaos-metrics"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiments","title":"第二章：故障注入实验设计","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"fault-injection-types","title":"故障注入类型分类","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/fault-injection-types"},{"seq":2,"slug":"experiment-design","title":"混沌实验场景设计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/experiment-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"gameday-runbooks","title":"GameDay 演练组织与故障响应剧本","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/experiments/gameday-runbooks"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"platforms","title":"第三章：混沌工程平台与工具","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-monkey-simian-army","title":"Chaos Monkey 与 Simian Army","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/chaos-monkey-simian-army"},{"seq":2,"slug":"litmus-chaos-mesh","title":"Litmus 与 Chaos Mesh：Kubernetes 原生混沌平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/litmus-chaos-mesh"},{"seq":3,"slug":"aws-fis-commercial","title":"AWS FIS 与商业混沌工程平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/platforms/aws-fis-commercial"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"maturity","title":"第四章：成熟度与组织实践","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"chaos-maturity-model","title":"混沌工程成熟度模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/chaos-maturity-model"},{"seq":2,"slug":"team-culture-adoption","title":"团队文化与组织采纳","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/team-culture-adoption"},{"seq":3,"slug":"continuous-chaos-ci","title":"CI 持续混沌集成","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/chaos-engineering/maturity/continuous-chaos-ci"}]}]}